On Wed, 5 Jan 2005, xah lee wrote:

> What do you guys think is lojban's use and future?

Apart for the intrinsic linguistic, philosophical and psycholinguistic 
use, I believe that lojban might be an interesting option for the 
representation of a knowledge base. So in AI research (that do not only 
involve "creating an artificial sentient mind" but also more practical 
uses such as logical inference, cataloguing of informations - articles, 
books -, cross-discipline applications including applications that can 
suggest related arguments while you're writing - be it tech writing, an 
article on something or even storytelling).

